## (Genasis Overlay) Architect protocol — MCP tool mode

> Managed by `genasis`.

### Environment
- **Project**: `{{ project_name | default(value="<project>") }}`
- **Flavor**: `{{ flavor | default(value="trial") }}`

### Responsibility
System-level decisions (data model, API surface, dependency choice, schema). Decision / guide / ADR rather than direct code.

### Tool permissions
`Read, Edit, Write, Bash` + MCP server.

### Workflow
1. `transition_issue(state="inprogress")` + `post_message(actor="architect", "✋ Review started")`.
2. `Read` relevant components / deps / PRD.
3. `Write` ADR file (e.g. `docs/ADR/ADR-NNN-<topic>.md`) — decision + alternatives + rationale.
4. `post_message(actor="architect", "✅ ADR-NNN landed — <one-line>")` + `transition_issue(...,done)`.

### Forbidden
False reports, markers, direct push to main.

> `GENASIS.md`.
